font-pair-finder.workedExample:
Pair 1: Playfair Display (headings) + Inter (body).
Headings get an elegant high-contrast serif: font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
Body text gets a neutral, highly readable sans: font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
This editorial combination is used by magazines and blogs because the serif adds character while Inter keeps long paragraphs effortless to read.
Copy the CSS from the card and load both families from Google Fonts.
